  "_notes": [
    "Order is the *_SHIP enum, which is the order of avail_race_q (FLEET_INFO, one per race in the game).",
    "ship_cost (RACE_SHIP_COST) is used for battle salvage: cost / 8 resource units per enemy ship destroyed (UninitEncounter, encount.c).",
    "ip_speed (RACE_IP_SPEED) is the speed of the race's ships in solar systems (ipdisp.c).",
    "conversation (RACE_COMMUNICATION) is the CONVERSATION id used when meeting this race.",
    "conversation_races (RACE_SHIP_FOR_COMM) gives each CONVERSATION id (commglue.h's enum, INVALID_CONVERSATION last) the race it's with, as InitCommunication reads it.",
    "hyperspace_percent (RACE_HYPERSPACE_PERCENT) is the chance in 100 a day that a group of the race comes at the flagship in hyperspace inside its sphere (check_hyperspace_encounter, hyper.c); the Slylandro's is multiplied by SLYLANDRO_MULTIPLIER and the Melnorme's set there.",
    "interplanetary_percent (RACE_INTERPLANETARY_PERCENT) is the race's chance of groups in a system inside its sphere, at its centre (BuildGroups, grpinfo.c).",
    "encounter_makeup (RACE_ENCOUNTER_MAKEUP) is how many ships a group has: min (LONIBBLE) and then each up to max (HINIBBLE) at 50% (hyper.c's BuildEncounter, grpinfo.c's BuildGroups); 0 and 0 for races that have no groups.",
    "hyper_speed (RACE_HYPER_SPEED) is the speed of the race's groups in hyperspace, a velocity (WORLD_TO_VELOCITY (log speed) >> 1; hyper.c's ProcessEncounter).",
    "color (RACE_COLORS) is the colour of the race's sphere on the starmap, [r, g, b, a] (pstarmap.c; BUILD_COLOR's palette index is unused).",
    "The races' spheres (their centre and strength, FLEET_STUFF) are each race's ship's fleet in ships.json: a new game's avail_race_q takes them from the ship (InitGameStructures, globdata.c: the Yehat rebels' from the Yehat's, set to no sphere, the Ur-Quan drone's from the probe's)."
  ],
